@shop = http://localhost:8080

### Seed products are named "Product N"
GET {{shop}}/api/v1/products/search?q=product 77

### Prefix: "prod 77" still matches "Product 77", "Product 770"...
GET {{shop}}/api/v1/products/search?q=product 7&size=5

### Page 2
GET {{shop}}/api/v1/products/search?q=product&page=1&size=5

### Symbols only → empty result, not a 500
GET {{shop}}/api/v1/products/search?q=!!!

### Page too deep → 400
GET {{shop}}/api/v1/products/search?q=product&page=50